          "quote": "The Al-4Fe-3Cr-2Ti (wt.%) ingots were subjected to gas atomization (PSI Hermiga 75/5VI) using argon under 40 bar pressure. The powder production and characterization details are provided elsewhere [57]. The gas-to-melt mass flow ratio (GMR) used here was 1.7.",
